 Over every component, the next tree starts at the first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order that is not spanned."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent"},"abstract":[{"text":"What Prim’s algorithm reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dijkstra visitor, which its Prim uses.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://SpanningTrees/documentation/SpanningTrees/PrimEvent/Equatable-Implementations":{"title":"Equatable Implementations","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/primevent\/equatable-implementations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/Equatable-Implementations","abstract":[],"role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://SpanningTrees/documentation/SpanningTrees/PrimEvent/finish(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/primevent\/finish(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"finish","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"PrimEvent.finish(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Every edge of the vertex has been read.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/finish(_:)"},"doc://SpanningTrees/s8CopyableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s8CopyableP","title":"Swift.Copyable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://SpanningTrees/s23CustomStringConvertibleP":{"title":"Swift.CustomStringConvertible","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://SpanningTrees/documentation/SpanningTrees/PrimEvent/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"CustomStri